        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: উপদেশ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "উপদেশ — upôdesh — \"a moral lesson; counsel\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "গল্পের শেষে দাদু একটা উপদেশ দিলেন। gôlper sheshe dādu ekṭā upôdesh dilen. At the end of the story my grandfather gave us a lesson to remember."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "উপদেশ (upôdesh) is Sanskrit upadeśa, 'pointing out; instruction, advice' (Monier-Williams); it has nothing to do with দেশ, a country. Everyday advice is পরামর্শ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
