          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বাধ্য হওয়া — bādhyô hôoyā — \"to be forced; to have no choice\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ঝড়ের জন্য জেলেরা ফিরে আসতে বাধ্য হল। jhôṛer jônyô jelerā phire āste bādhyô hôlô. Because of the storm the fishermen were forced to come back."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): তিনি বাড়ি বেচতে বাধ্য হলেন, tini bāṛi bechte bādhyô hôlen."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বাধ্য হওয়া (bādhyô hôoyā) puts Sanskrit bādhya, 'to be pressed hard, held back' (Monier-Williams), before হওয়া: to be pressed into something. It takes the -তে form: যেতে বাধ্য হল, had to go."
            }
          ]
        },
